        <mxCell id="7Irn46h-RqsZyk3exOB6-4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8.5pt;&quot;&gt;7.7 says authorized drivers are &#39;only known through their company&#39;. The interview (Rana Adel, Section 8) says some of them are also individual customers with their own&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8.5pt;&quot;&gt;account.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="550" x="180" y="1270" as="geometry" />
